  "body": "Boasting 90sqm of beautifully designed living, including a 19sqm covered deck, this stunning apartment captures the afternoon sun and offers the perfect retreat for relaxing with a book or enjoying a late-afternoon gin and tonic, something the vendors have truly cherished during the three years since purchasing the home off the plans. It is with genuine reluctance that they leave Kensington Park.\r\n\r\nEntertaining is effortless thanks to the spacious open-plan design, full-height glazing, and refined kitchen featuring quality cabinetry and premium Miele appliances. Elegant window furnishings enhance the sense of calm and sophistication throughout. The generous master bedroom opens directly onto the deck, while the fully tiled bathroom includes underfloor heating for year-round comfort. A cleverly concealed laundry sits behind bi-fold doors, complemented by additional storage space.\r\n\r\nThis premium apartment also includes a secure basement car park and a large storage locker. A shared lift provides seamless access throughout the building, offering secure, easy single-level living with no stairs to navigate.\r\n\r\nDesigned for low-maintenance living, this home gives you the freedom to lock up and leave, travel with ease, or simply enjoy life without the burden of constant upkeep. Kensington Park is a thoughtfully master-planned community offering a resort-style lifestyle, complete with beautifully landscaped grounds, an indoor heated pool, gym, on-site café, and a welcoming neighbourhood atmosphere.\r\n\r\nOrewa Beach is just a short 450m stroll away, while village shops, restaurants, and scenic coastal walkways are all close at hand. Commuting is easy too, with the motorway on-ramp conveniently nearby.\r\n\r\nVisit today and discover why Kensington Park remains one of New Zealand's most sought-after freehold coastal communities,  intentionally designed for those who appreciate quality, lifestyle, and ease of living.\r\n\r\nCall Tonia today to view this exceptional home.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty Ltd is Licensed REAA 2008",
